{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11106330","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11106330","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1110633001:0":{"text":"저기, 크루거 님... 일부러 수소문한 건 아닌데요!","source_cn":"那个，克鲁格大人……我发誓我没刻意去打听！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFBFA0AE1FD7AF47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1110633002:0":{"text":"이번 경기 이후에 블랙하울 부족 사람들이 오우거보다는 크루거 님을 지지하게 되었다고 하더라고요.","source_cn":"但听说那场比赛之后，不少黑嚎族人从支持奥格转向支持您了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C3C798EB01B0E2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110633003:0":{"text":"... 그런 소문의 존재를 부정하진 않지만, 그런 소문 때문에 나와 오우거 간의 신뢰가 흔들릴 일은 없어.","source_cn":"……我不否认这样的流言存在，但它们不会动摇血亲之间的信任。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x978B4DCD1F3200D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:克鲁格":{"text":"크루거","source":"克鲁格","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}